Atlas","/farmland-atlas/north-dakota/billings-county"],["ARC or PLC in Billings County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/billings-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value ran 188% of normal for October to November and 51% for February to March. In 2026 so far, the middle sits at 35% of normal for February to March and 63% for June to July. Grid 32506 had its driest year in 1988 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
